<title>UK: TABLE-ORANGE H1 PRETAX LOSS NARROWS.</title>
<headline>TABLE-ORANGE H1 PRETAX LOSS NARROWS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr loss (pence)	  6.0	    vs  13.0</p>
<p> Pretax loss		73.5	    vs 125.2</p>
<p> Turnover		  426.9	    vs 256.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax loss in a range between 73 and 103 million stg.</p>
<p>The company said monthly revenue per subscriber (RPS) was up nine percent to 40.16 stg.</p>
<p>RPS is now running at a rate of 500 stg per year versus 442.</p>
<p>Full company name - Orange Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
